      "seq": 3,
      "text": "Consciousness refers to the mental state of being aware of one's thoughts, emotions, and experiences. It encompasses the ability to perceive reality, engage in meaningful thought, and experience emotions. This concept is central to various philosophical and scientific inquiries, including neuroscience and quantum physics.",
